      "url": "https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/a/ad/Fort_Chambly%2C_bastion_de_coin_avec_%C3%A9chauguette_et_meurtri%C3%A8res_et_embrasures.jpg",
      "descriptionUrl": "https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Fort_Chambly,_bastion_de_coin_avec_%C3%A9chauguette_et_meurtri%C3%A8res_et_embrasures.jpg",
      "width": 5616,
